[{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0002","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0545","title":"ZeroShell 1.0beta11 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"ZeroShell 1.0beta11 及更早版本的 cgi-bin/kerbynet 脚本中存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向 NoAuthREQ x509List 动作的 type 参数中注入 shell 元字符，触发任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 ZeroShell 1.0beta11 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前官方尚未发布补丁，建议限制相关页面的网络访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0545"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2009-02-12T23:30:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:05:16Z","remediation":"升级至 ZeroShell 1.0beta12 或更高版本；若无法升级，对 1.0beta11 应用官方补丁 C100（zeroshell.net/eng/patch-details/#C100）；临时缓解措施：在防火墙或反向代理层限制对 /cgi-bin/kerbynet 的未授权访问，并对 web 管理控制台启用 IP 白名单或 HTTP 认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ikkisoft.com/stuff/LC-2009-01.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/500763/100/0/threaded","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2009/0385","http://www.zeroshell.net/eng/announcements/","http://www.zeroshell.net/eng/patch-details/#C100","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/8023","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0545.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2009/CVE-2009-0545.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/490586283f9ca1596471e5230c91d74f96495bb9/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0545.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2009-0545-1407.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2009-0545.js","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-0545_%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2009-0545-1402.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2009-0545-1405.yaml","https://github.com/cristianovisk/cves_data_intelligence/blob/a227a6d4eb587f5f63e576bb52bd153b254c12e4/honeypots/2009/CVE-2009-0545.json","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0545.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/30/Artifact/Report.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0023","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0376","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"这是一个影响 RealPlayer 的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过精心构造的 Internet Video Recording (IVR) 文件触发。漏洞存在于 RealPlayer 运行时 DLL 文件中，由于对特定字段长度控制不足导致堆 corruption，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 10 至 11.0.4 版本、RealPlayer Enterprise、Mac RealPlayer 10/10.1、Linux RealPlayer 10 及 Helix Player 10.x 等多个平台和操作系统。攻击者无需身份验证，只需向目标发送恶意 IVR 文件即可利用此漏洞，攻击过程可能通过 Windows Explorer 插件完成。漏洞 CVSS 评分高达 9.3，攻击者可完全控制受影响系统，窃取敏感数据或安装恶意软件。攻击者还可能通过邮件附件、网络共享或其他文件传输方式传播恶意 IVR 文件。RealNetworks 已发布安全补丁，升级到 RealPlayer SP 1.0.5 或更高版本可修复此漏洞。用户应及时更新 RealPlayer 到最新安全版本，以防止此类威胁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0376"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2009-02-08T21:30:09Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:53Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 RealPlayer SP 1.0.5 或更高版本（RealPlayer 11.0.5+、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.0+、Mac RealPlayer 10.1.1+、Linux RealPlayer 10.0.1+、Helix Player 10.1+）。若暂时无法升级，可在 Windows 资源管理器中取消 .ivr 文件关联，或在防火墙层面禁止 RealPlayer 访问网络，禁用 RealPlayer 浏览器插件作为临时缓解措施。Windows 用户可通过“控制面板 → 程序 → 默认程序 → 设置关联”取消 .ivr 关联；Linux/Mac 用户可删除或重命名 RealPlayer 浏览器插件文件（如 /usr/lib/mozilla/plugins/nphelix*.so）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/33810","http://secunia.com/advisories/38218","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/01192010_player/en/","http://www.fortiguardcenter.com/advisory/FGA-2009-04.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/500722/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/509097/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/33652","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0178","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-009/","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/48568","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2009/0xxx/CVE-2009-0376.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-0376","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2009-0376.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-0376.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q369-qc62-gmgr/GHSA-q369-qc62-gmgr.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2009/gb_realplayer_ivr_mult_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_0_319.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_115300_115400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4dd0d759-92b9-454a-8fde-ee20f9cbdaee.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2009/CVE-2009-0376.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0021","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0375","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer IVR 文件缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 多版本（RealPlayer 10、10.5、11、Enterprise 版、Mac 10/10.1、Linux 10 及 Helix Player 10.x）在处理 Internet Video Recording (IVR) 文件时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可构造文件名长度字段包含巨大整数的恶意 IVR 文件，诱导用户通过 Windows 资源管理器插件打开，触发任意内存位置被 0x00 字节覆盖，导致任意代码远程执行。漏洞影响 Windows、Mac、Linux 多平台多版本 RealPlayer 及 Helix Player，CVSS 9.3 严重级别，攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意文件即可实现远程代码执行，RealNetworks 已发布 RealPlayer SP 1.0.5 修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0375"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2009-02-08T21:30:09Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:53Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 SP 1.0.5 或更高版本（RealPlayer 11.0.5+、RealPlayer 10.5 6.0.12.1742+、RealPlayer 10 修补版）。无法立即升级时，在 Windows 资源管理器中取消关联 .ivr 文件，或卸载 RealPlayer Windows Explorer 插件（卸载 ivfsrc.ax 过滤器），禁止打开不可信的 IVR 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/33810","http://secunia.com/advisories/38218","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/01192010_player/en/","http://www.fortiguardcenter.com/advisory/FGA-2009-04.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/500722/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/33652","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0178","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/48567","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2009/0xxx/CVE-2009-0375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-0375","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2009-0375.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-0375.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-x474-4899-v7hv/GHSA-x474-4899-v7hv.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2009/gb_realplayer_ivr_mult_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_0_319.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_115300_115400.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x34000/33652/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0001","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0347","title":"Autonomy Ultraseek cs.html 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Autonomy (原 Verity) Ultraseek 搜索引擎的 cs.html 页面存在开放重定向漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 url 参数传入恶意构造的外部链接，诱使用户访问该参数的 URL，从而将用户重定向至任意第三方网站，配合钓鱼攻击窃取敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Autonomy Ultraseek 相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。攻击可在未认证条件下远程发起，利用复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0347"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2009-01-29T19:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:49Z","remediation":"联系 Autonomy 官方技术支持获取修复了 cs.html 开放重定向漏洞的 Ultraseek 更新版本；如无法及时升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截包含 /cs.html?url= 路径的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施，同时应对 url 参数传入的目标域名进行白名单校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunbeltblog.blogspot.com/2009/01/constant-stream-of-ultraseek-redirects.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/202753","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/33500","http://www.ultraseek.com/forums/thread.jspa?messageID=9818","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/48336","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/32766","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/